# The docker build context is jaja/ (moon runs the docker task from the project
# root), and the Dockerfile copies exactly one thing: the release that
# `moon run jaja:build` produced. Everything else is either irrelevant to the
# image or actively unwanted in the context - deps/ and _build/ are hundreds of
# MB, and .envrc holds live Google OAuth and Aiven database credentials.
#
# Allowlist rather than denylist, so anything added to the project later is
# excluded by default.
*
!_build/prod/rel/jaja
